    "description": "Gatehouse, level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Needs scaffolding: 11 tall (L3 cones: 20). Over budget: 841 blocks vs 415 (L3 cones about 200). Twin-tower stone gate for the batch-3 stone wall line (wall face z 3, walk z 4..5 at stand 5, joining at x 1 and x 13): arched passage, gate room over it, crenellated tops; stairs (no ladders) from the passage up to the wall walk, the gate room and both fighting tops. L2 banners, iron bars, portcullis, lamp posts; L3 steep slate cones with flags, murder holes. Not yet builder-tested: iron_bars, red_wall_banner, stone_brick_wall. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern, item.",
